OL,3,ABurnham to hand long-range missile
OL,4,Ablueprints to Zelensky as he visits
OL,5,AKyiv
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham is marking his first
OL,8,Fforeign visit as prime minister with a
OL,9,Ftrip to Kyiv - and will hand over
OL,10,Fblueprints so Ukraine can build its own
OL,11,Flong-range missiles.
OL,13,FThe prime minister will chair his first
OL,14,Fmeeting of the "coalition of the
OL,15,Fwilling", set up by the UK and France
OL,16,Funder his predecessor, Sir Keir
OL,17,FStarmer.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
PN,30202
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1787549230
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABurnham to hand long-range missile
OL,4,Ablueprints to Zelensky as he visits
OL,5,AKyiv
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe is also set to accept an award on
OL,8,Fbehalf of the British people
OL,9,Frecognising the UK's support for
OL,10,FUkraine and to take part in
OL,11,Findependence day events.
OL,13,FCrucially for the war effort, he will
OL,14,Fannounce his government has agreed to
OL,15,Fallow defence company MBDA to
OL,16,Fdeclassify information on UK components
OL,17,Ffor the long-range Scalp missile ` the
OL,18,FFrench equivalent of the UK's Storm
OL,19,FShadow.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
